  "Laboratoire": ["Laboratory", "مختبر", "Laboratwari", "Laboratuwaar"],
  "Un centre de recherche dédié à l'avancement scientifique. Publications, projets innovants et expertise multidisciplinaire.": ["A research center dedicated to scientific advancement. Publications, innovative projects and multidisciplinary expertise.", "مركز أبحاث مكرس للتقدم العلمي. منشورات ومشاريع مبتكرة وخبرة متعددة التخصصات.", "Ɲinini so min bɛ siyansi ɲɛtaa kama. Weleweledaw, porozɛ kuraw ani dɔnniya fan caman na.", "Galle ɓeydaari diisnaaɗo ngam yaltude ganndal. Winndannde, porose kese e ganndal fannuuji ɗuuɗɗi."],
  "Nos Publications": ["Our Publications", "منشوراتنا", "An ka weleweledaw", "Winndannde amen"],
