  "Nous sommes ouverts aux collaborations scientifiques et aux partenariats de recherche.": ["We are open to scientific collaborations and research partnerships.", "نحن منفتحون على التعاون العلمي وشراكات البحث.", "An da bɛ siyansi jɛ-baaraw ni ɲinini jɛɲɔgɔnyaw ma.", "Men ngoni udditiiɓe e gollondiral ganndal e kafidiral ɓeydaari."],
