  "Vous n'avez pas encore de compte professionnel.": ["You don't have a professional account yet.", "ليس لديك حساب مهني بعد.", "Baarakɛ jatebɔsɛbɛn tɛ i bolo fɔlɔ.", "A jogaa konte golle tawo."],
