  "Écrivez votre activité (ex. Chef de quartier, Imam, Enseignant…)": ["Write your activity (e.g. Neighborhood chief, Imam, Teacher…)", "اكتب نشاطك (مثال: رئيس الحي، إمام، معلم…)", "I ka baara sɛbɛn (i n'a fɔ Kartiye kuntigi, Limamu, Karamɔgɔ…)", "Winndu golle maa (ko wayi no Mawɗo kartiye, Almaami, Jannginoowo…)"],
