  "Expliquez ce que vous apportez (vision, idée, travail déjà fait)": ["Explain what you bring (vision, idea, work already done)", "اشرح ما تقدمه (رؤية، فكرة، عمل منجز)", "I bɛ min di, o ɲɛfɔ (yeli, miiri, baara kɛlen kaban)", "Faamnu ko ndokkataa (yiyannde, miijo, golle gasɗe gilla)"],
